mission "The Narrows Watch"
    category "side"
    name "The Narrows Watch"
    description "Drive off a single raider threatening the small coasters near Redoubt, then report to Mariner's Rest."
    source "Redoubt"
    destination "Mariner's Rest"
    reward 520
    objective kills 1
    battlefield "The Gull Narrows" 16888.9 5518.2
    enemy "The Black Needle"
    speaker offer "Warden Sloane"
    speaker visit "Harbourmaster Pell"
    speaker complete "Harbourmaster Pell"
    on offer
        conversation
            `Warden Sloane has a chart open on the table. A single black-sailed brig has been stopping small coasters in the Gull Narrows and taking their cargoes. The raider has not attacked the ports, only the working boats.`
            `"I have no call for a fleet action," Sloane says. "One ship, one captain, one lesson. Drive her off, then report to Pell at Mariner's Rest. He has the names of the crews who were robbed."`
            choice
                `"I'll deal with one raider."`
                    accept
                `"The militia can find another captain."`
                    close
    on accept
        log "Accepted The Narrows Watch. Sink The Black Needle in the Gull Narrows, then report to Mariner's Rest."
    on visit
        conversation
            `Harbourmaster Pell hears the news and rings a small handbell. "That is one less black sail troubling the coasters. The crews will be glad to use the Narrows again."`
    on complete
        conversation
            `Pell gives you the promised purse and a list of the recovered cargoes. "The owners will see their goods returned. A small service, perhaps, but these small boats are the life of the islands."`
